DST",42,-5,0,0,0.0,0,"",0,0,0,173]],"notes":{"3139477":{"tone":"warn","short":"ACL+LCL","note":"Tore ACL and LCL Dec 2025. Week 1 is 2 days shy of his 9-month recovery mark and Andy Reid will not commit him. Projection assumes a full healthy season."},"4427366":{"tone":"warn","short":"committee","note":"Mid-August groin injury plus the coach wants a three-back committee. Volume case is weaker than the projection."},"4870808":{"tone":"warn","short":"high ankle","note":"High ankle sprain, out for preseason, team only hoping for Week 1. High ankles linger."},"3040151":{"tone":"warn","short":"Achilles return","note":"Activated from PUP Aug 23, racing back from a torn Achilles with no preseason reps. An age-33 TE on an Achilles is an early-season floor risk, not a season-ender - but temper the first month."},"5083076":{"tone":"warn","short":"QB change","note":"Falling after the Browns named Deshaun Watson starter."},"3045147":{"tone":"warn","short":"IR foot","note":"Placed on IR Aug 29 (foot) with a return designation - out at least the first 4 games. Undraftable in a 3-bench league."},"3117251":{"tone":"warn","short":"questionable","note":"Questionable; missed over a week with tightness the team is managing. Long injury history."},"4685278":{"tone":"warn","short":"groin","note":"Missed preseason with a groin injury. Risky at ADP - Rome Odunze benefits."},"3043078":{"tone":"warn","short":"age 32","note":"Age-32 season. No RB since 2000 has averaged 16 ppg at 32+, only three managed 14. Volume is safe, efficiency is the risk."},"4567048":{"tone":"good","short":"bell cow","note":"Zach Charbonnet tore his ACL in January - Walker owns the entire KC backfield. Market has not fully repriced this. Best value on our board."},"4361579":{"tone":"good","short":"bell cow","note":"Re-signed by Dallas, projected for genuine workhorse volume (~1,280 rush yds, 15 total TD)."},"4890973":{"tone":"good","short":"300+ touches","note":"Kubiak wide-zone scheme fits him; staff targeting 300-335 touches plus a bigger passing role. Rookie-year letdown is your discount."},"4362628":{"tone":"good","short":"cleared","note":"Aug 25 knee scare was a minor hyperextension; said he could play the next day. Held out purely as precaution. Draft normally."},"4689114":{"tone":"good","short":"top plateau QB","note":"8 top-10 weeks as a rookie in ~12 games. New staff, healthy Nabers, real rushing upside. Best of the QB plateau. Caveat: concussion history from how he runs."},"4426338":{"tone":"good","short":"QB11 ppg","note":"Finished QB11 in points per game even in a down year, age 26. Worth a top-4-round pick in superflex."},"4242335":{"tone":"warn","short":"QB-dependent","note":"Was RB2 per game with Daniel Jones healthy, RB22 without him. Jones returns from an Achilles tear. Huge range of outcomes."},"4429160":{"tone":"warn","short":"new OC","note":"New OC Bobby Slowik plans to run more, but 43% of his PPR value came through the air and Malik Willis rarely checks down. Receiving floor is the risk."},"4426515":{"tone":"good","short":"practicing","note":"Groin scare is behind him - returned to full practice Aug 30 and trending to play Week 1."},"4258173":{"tone":"good","short":"target funnel","note":"Jayden Higgins (torn ACL, out for the year) and Tank Dell (IR, ACL+MCL) are both gone - Houston's WR target tree collapses onto him. Late-August news the market may not have priced yet."},"4431459":{"tone":"warn","short":"groin-limited","note":"Groin injury has kept him limited through late camp. Team calls it minor, but reps have been sparse - small discount vs a clean TE3."},"4572680":{"tone":"warn","short":"ACL Week 1?","note":"Coming off last season's torn ACL; as of late Aug the team says only 'a shot' to be ready for Week 1."},"4426385":{"tone":"warn","short":"PUP 4+ games","note":"Moved to reserve/PUP Aug 29 (ACL recovery) - out at least the first 4 games. IR-stash only."}}}